            "title": "Which TOG do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>0.5 TOG for rooms 24°C and above. 1.0 TOG for year-round use in rooms 20–24°C. 2.5 TOG for cool rooms below 20°C or winter use. Always check room temperature before dressing baby for sleep.</p>"
